    "id": "ACT-GRAM",
    "revision": 7,
    "title": "Describe scattered actions and limits",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk6-distribution-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Describe scattered actions and limits",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Put the endpoint between these framing words. The endpoint can bound an activity or the period considered when stating a result; say which is intended. A + one + classifier, B + one + classifier distributes items among participants. 东一…西一… depicts scattered placement rather than two precise compass locations.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "活动到十二点为止。",
                "pinyin": "huódòng dào shí èr diǎn wéizhǐ 。",
                "meaning": "The activity runs until twelve.",
                "audio": "c430434d233fcf8cd85bb4443ff9e9a3c1e3fcc00a56b970d21c2f5b7d277e8d"
              },
              {
                "text": "到十二点为止，他只写了三个字。",
                "pinyin": "dào shí èr diǎn wéizhǐ ， tā zhǐ xiě le sān gè zì 。",
                "meaning": "As of twelve, he had written only three characters.",
                "audio": "81c795a4a35d44e42aa20999a7ecb9abb9b6f42bc06b4338f1b18327dcdff6a7"
              },
              {
                "text": "你一本，我一本。",
                "pinyin": "nǐ yī běn ， wǒ yī běn 。",
                "meaning": "One book for you and one for me.",
                "audio": "ccbbdb1bb0e6f305e49afcbdcbe09001c0ce501e1208848d716986f5907ee424"
              },
              {
                "text": "房间里东一本书，西一本书。",
                "pinyin": "fángjiān lǐ dōng yī běn shū ， xī yī běn shū 。",
                "meaning": "Books are scattered here and there in the room.",
                "audio": "5e4db09d6911248ab75cc3f19e49c74a4d5ec5392a037395210edfa213b616b6"
              }
            ]
          },
